    "description": "<p>Luna Exalted her Chosen to protect that which is worth defending. Synchronizing her mercurial Essence with a target within (Dexterity) yards, the Lunar is considered to be reflexively warding that individual with a Defend Other action for the rest of the scene, as long as she remains within appropriate guarding range. Vigilant Mastiff Technique may be used to benefit only one target at a time. The Lunar must cancel the Charm and re-invoke it to change wards.</p>",
